# Detector information:

Scintillator     CsI_1
CsI_1.DetectorVolume	 Scint1Detector
CsI_1.SensitiveVolume    Scint1Detector
CsI_1.TriggerThreshold   10.0
CsI_1.EnergyResolution   Gauss  59.5    59.5   6.95
CsI_1.EnergyResolution   Gauss  511.0  511.0   18.49
CsI_1.NoiseThresholdEqualsTriggerThreshold true

